{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0053_1000_009rit", "source_sha256": "ae1576b7c371b7a556a6ae05c10413e844f4c446e9ae032dd7fa31e475c4a9ad", "ja": "送ってもらって、すみません。\nありがとうございます、{$P$}。", "zh": "不好意思，还麻烦你送我过来，\n谢谢你，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0053_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5c122ff50952415f42805a95010c5545ec508c5b3b2d4109dba5b294a4ff13b7", "ja": "いや、こっちこそ。みんなの自転車、整備してくれて\nありがとうな。本当にお疲れ様！", "zh": "不会，我才要道谢。\n谢谢你替大家整备自行车。辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0053_1002_p", "source_sha256": "18d80f2e545d2af242a6418c3d337cac8a00569d77442d14a30432a26ca0b6f6", "ja": "アイドル対抗ロードレース……。\nおかげで、みんな順調に走れそうだ。", "zh": "偶像对抗公路自行车赛……\n多亏有你的帮忙，大家应该都能顺利上路了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0053_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "1a15879ea624e53df862bbf5114755d95f228080c292945575fd1b6a7453c61e", "ja": "えへへ。元々好きなんですよね～、\n機械を整備したり、色々と準備したりするの。", "zh": "嘿嘿，因为我本来就很喜欢做这些事了～\n像是整备机械、做些事前准备之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0053_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "044c6105e0d95959be1f209ef8bf72cb6ac20f9d9cdf6c7635a33610ee2529f2", "ja": "それに、可愛い後輩たちのためですから！\nこれくらいは、安いもんです。", "zh": "而且，这都是为了可爱的后辈们啊！\n这点小事不算什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0053_1005_p", "source_sha256": "8cff4831d01a44cc3031572323df7051da75976370992132de4b34bbcdfbf160", "ja": "とはいえ、今夜はしっかり休んでくれよ。\n律子だって、明日のレースに出るんだから。", "zh": "不过，今晚你可要好好休息喔。\n律子，别忘了你自己明天也要参赛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0053_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "6aec472a2bd2836743f9d20b977f42ecff78e15435aba801a04bafe93865e9a9", "ja": "その点はご安心を。シミュレーションは完ぺきですし、\nコンディションもバッチリです！", "zh": "这件事你尽管放心。我赛前模拟做得十分完美，\n身体状况也毫无问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0053_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "5c8cec6e2aac15c0015081b3dfe8442166d4d91ce5ccc57d31256b0eb4e33ec1", "ja": "ひそかに入賞、狙ってますからね～。\n自分の自転車の整備も、そりゃもうぬかりなく♪", "zh": "我可是暗中盘算着要得奖呢～\n我自己的自行车也整备得无微不至♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0053_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0e4416c49cb4fb64ab7b51eacd57bff949d629c49ba26be3bc5a659ba2ed6115", "ja": "おっ、さすがだな。\nこれは明日のレース、期待できそうだ！", "zh": "喔！果然厉害。\n看来明天的比赛值得期待了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0053_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "7f31efad5a906535859001b40ea05eace0fea0149748024952f35ba3e7edcf44", "ja": "そりゃもう、期待していいですよ～！　ちなみに私は、\n{$P$}殿に期待してますから♪", "zh": "那当然，尽管期待吧～！顺带一提，\n我也很期待{$P$}阁下喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0053_1010_p", "source_sha256": "5e0d9c9f6683d821af76eacbd8aaf898754aba919da4826681f7f0eddb96ac26", "ja": "えっ？　俺に……何を期待してるんだ？", "zh": "咦？期待我……期待我什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0053_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "3e54bd8fffab52c37f38a41fbf5c6479a04eb6c54afb7f955553ea89a807dc2c", "ja": "ペースメーカーです♪　あ、大丈夫大丈夫！\nとある区間だけでいいですから！", "zh": "你要担任配速员啊♪啊，不用太担心！\n只需要骑一小段路而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0053_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "48aecffff8a75b9280de7067efe11f1e11a4326740172b7a59854db330605916", "ja": "斜度35度の上り坂。あそこだけ、風よけが欲しくて。\n……あ、もちろん、自転車の整備もバッチリです♪", "zh": "有段坡度35度的上坡，那一段路需要有人帮忙破风。\n……啊，你的自行车当然也整备好啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
